WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.761
Use this guide when deciding how to reshape If
category values should

00:00:05.774 --> 00:00:11.294
become columns pivot with conditional aggregation If
columns should

00:00:11.321 --> 00:00:16.827
become rows use UNION ALL or lateral VALUES Keep
dynamic

00:00:16.853 --> 00:00:22.469
categories long when possible Use a wide form for
stable matrix

00:00:22.495 --> 00:00:28.039
reporting And whenever several source rows map to
one cell make the

00:00:28.052 --> 00:00:29.657
aggregate decision explicit
